    lines:
    - Back already? And in one piece.
    - Hm. Three hounds. Don't let it go to your head, Cinder.
    dailyVariants: []
    onShow: []
    choices: []
  - id: first_day
    conditions:
    - type: 10
      key: q_cinder_seat
      values: []
      value: 0
      value2: 0
      negate: 0
    lines:
    - So you're the Cinder Seat.
    - Rank E. Lowest reading this academy has ever logged.
    - Don't look at me like that. I teach the class nobody else wants. Find your
      bed. Field work starts tomorrow.
    dailyVariants: []
    onShow: []
    choices: []
  - id: default
    conditions: []
    lines:
    - Training ground's to the east. The board has work if you want coin.
    dailyVariants:
    - Rain makes the hounds bolder. Keep your guard up.
    - Sleep. You look worse than usual.
    - Read the notices. Some of them are even true.
    onShow: []
    choices: []
